# The build context is the package plus its manifest; everything below is either large,
# machine-local, or reconstructible, and none of it is read by the image.
.git
.github
.vscode
docs
artifacts
debug
test
*.png
*.log

# Deliberately NOT ignored: Manifest.toml. It is git-ignored (see .gitignore) but must reach the
# image, so the container resolves to the same package versions as the machine that built it.
# See gcp/README.md, "Reproducibility".
